{"meta":{"id":"tt39240299","type":"series","name":"Magical Girl Raising Project: Restart","imdb_id":"tt39240299","description":"Once again, sixteen Magical Girls have been assembled for a high-stakes challenge. Every three days, their Magical Phone pulls them into an RPG-like simulation where they have to work together to fight enemies, solve puzzles, and earn Magical Candy to advance. A staggering ten billion yen reward awaits them at the end—but only for the players who land the finishing blow. With such a tantalizing prize on the line, it's only a matter of time before the girls turn on each other—and if their hit points drop to zero, a game over will be the least of their worries...","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt39240299.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a5ibYt8Ri2w74TR99lbP2aHyFMY.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oPcuaK02bY2Gcs6qViDHn7mB98k.png","genres":["Animación","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2026-","released":"2026-10-06T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","country":"Japan","cast":["井上ほの花","南條愛乃","近藤玲奈","悠木碧","内田真礼","小清水亜美","伊瀬茉莉也","三上枝織","ジェーニャ","市道真央","鬼頭明里","Maria Naganawa","富田美憂","鈴代紗弓","ファイルーズあい","澤田姫","潘めぐみ","かないみか","東山奈央"],"writer":["吉岡たかを"],"links":[{"name":"Animación","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Animaci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"井上ほの花","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%E4%BA%95%E4%B8%8A%E3%81%BB%E3%81%AE%E8%8A%B1"},{"name":"南條愛乃","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%E5%8D%97%E6%A2%9D%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%83"},{"name":"近藤玲奈","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%E8%BF%91%E8%97%A4%E7%8E%B2%E5%A5%88"},{"name":"悠木碧","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%E6%82%A0%E6%9C%A8%E7%A2%A7"},{"name":"内田真礼"